      },
      "behavior-4": {
        "description": "A pending iteration may be named by active_iteration or interrupted_iteration.directory, never both. Its directory must be iteration-N+1 within max_iterations; a pending task ID must be new. Active requires null stop_reason; interrupted requires stop_reason=interrupted. Its ledger is read at the same relative path. Missing pending ledger is valid and means unknown usage, represented by null, never zero. An existing malformed pending ledger is an error. In-flight count is the number of requests with status=in_flight_or_interrupted.",
